1
00:00:00,260 --> 00:00:02,600
- I don't understand...
- Bup, bup, bup.

2
00:00:04,264 --> 00:00:07,814
- Okay, but earlier it seemed like...
- No talking.

3
00:00:09,520 --> 00:00:12,810
(Leonard:)Even during?
Because sometimes I have questions.

4
00:00:20,447 --> 00:00:22,697
(Penny:)Well, that was fun.

5
00:00:23,742 --> 00:00:26,452
(Leonard:)Yeah. Except for when
I got the foot cramp.

6
00:00:26,662 --> 00:00:28,162
(Penny:)You hung in there though.

7
00:00:28,372 --> 00:00:31,042
(Leonard:)There was a lot at stake.

8
00:00:32,626 --> 00:00:34,376
So, what do you wanna do now?

9
00:00:34,545 --> 00:00:38,425
Well, I wanna go get my asthma inhaler,
but it might ruin the moment.

10
00:00:41,176 --> 00:00:46,056
So help me out, here.
How does a miserable date end in sex?

11
00:00:46,640 --> 00:00:48,560
(Penny:)I don't know, it's complicated.

12
00:00:48,767 --> 00:00:52,727
I'm pretty smart guy, and right now my
brain has dibs on the blood supply...

13
00:00:52,896 --> 00:00:54,646
(Leonard:)...so give it a go.

14
00:00:55,816 --> 00:00:57,396
(Penny:)Okay. It's just...

15
00:00:57,818 --> 00:01:01,158
At that restaurant when you said
you wanted us to be together again...

